WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:03.520
Games.

2
00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:06.390
Interactive worlds.

3
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:09.330
Characters that come alive.

4
00:00:09.650 --> 00:00:13.750
I'm Édouard, a former journalist, now a 42 student.

5
00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:19.390
I build these projects with AI agents… and I sign them: MajorTakito.

6
00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:21.250
This is my portfolio.

7
00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:23.620
Not a page. A room.

8
00:00:23.700 --> 00:00:26.040
The octopus answers when you click.

9
00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:36.930
And on this old computer, a game I wrote: DOONT.

10
00:00:40.750 --> 00:00:45.230
It runs on my own kernel, written in Rust, right in your browser.

11
00:00:47.600 --> 00:00:52.540
Now, picture your own shop. Here, a bakery: La Fournée.

12
00:00:52.540 --> 00:00:55.370
Its mascot welcomes every visitor.

13
00:00:55.370 --> 00:00:59.670
Ask it a question: it answers from the bakery's own documents.

14
00:01:01.200 --> 00:01:05.180
When the jars run low, the stock warns the supplier.

15
00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:11.370
MajorTakito prepares the quote and the invoice. Nothing goes out without me.

16
00:01:12.300 --> 00:01:14.540
And any other tool you need.

17
00:01:15.600 --> 00:01:17.740
All of this, since October.

18
00:01:18.700 --> 00:01:24.800
Behind it, my workshop, MajorTakito, directs the AI agents and checks their work.

19
00:01:25.600 --> 00:01:29.480
A living site, a game, a mascot for your project?

20
00:01:29.500 --> 00:01:31.530
Let's talk, over a coffee.

21
00:01:31.880 --> 00:01:33.050
Thank you!

22
00:01:37.550 --> 00:01:39.150
You'd be the first.
